{"v":4,"catch":"人類已經發起了最後的反擊。 \nA-JAX，進攻！","desc":"“A-JAX”是KONAMI於1987年發布的射擊遊戲。\n玩家扮演著代號為“A-JAX”的特種作戰部隊的角色，目的是消滅一群外來入侵者。 使用浮華的音效和音樂作品，這項工作領先於時代。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-04-22","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57ffe31b95da7cbfa0cb58748ba5164e1d10645499f92616450f50e65641527b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd3ca82c244dde63e34d78850785268453c53d3180ad1f67ebdb876dce05eb3f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d86fd5de3f0f295b62060559953cf8252d6bfd42c0a03609b7a18072a03d028d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b3a02e0baecdaf8ab7f4b517fcba73943aeac4b92275d5235bc63ce13522e70.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b0a347365578d7b1fb7748de6aca3bf1abbb4b2020bf7e06f82ead3b8c62a3d5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a02df1cb026ddfc720105bb97599406dcab93e04d754b6fe2b6cf1428c92aa90.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c240148e4000","dlc":[]}